    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">25 Missions</h2>Bomber 3 is not a flight simulator, it is an intensely realistic action-adventure recreating the sights, sounds, and split-second decisions of the young B-17 crews in the skies of Nazi Germany. Digitized sound, Animations, and a ten-man crew to talk you through the tough ones.<br><br><br>And so it goes for twenty-five missions, Assuming, of course, you make it home from this one.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are in control</h2>Put yourself in the captain\u2019s seat of a B-17 bomber, select your plane, select your crew and plot your path over war-torn Europe. Watch your elevation, watch your formation, and watch very carefully where you were over the target. This classic was a bestseller in the early 1990s.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deadly Games Classic Reborn</h2>Staying true to its original HyperCard heritage the core game will look and feel the same as Rene Vidmer's original, but the game will be delivered on an updated engine.",
